<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 179 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 179 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 179 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    Five years     141	     141		  10.00 pct</p>
<p>    15 years	  38		38		  10.50 pct</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	    179	    179</p>
<p>Maturity date was set for March 10, 1997.</p>
<p>($1= 9.4 dirhams) - Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
